      finalAnswer: "\\( F_s(x)\\sim\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty (-1)^n (s)_n\\,x^n \\) with \\( (s)_n=\\Gamma(s+n)/\\Gamma(s) \\); \\( s=1\\Rightarrow n! \\), \\( s=2\\Rightarrow (n+1)! \\).",
